  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong>  <span style=\"color: #000000;\">has released the notification for the post of School Lecturer (Special). This recruitment has been issued for 121 posts. Online applying process for Rajasthan RPSC School Lecturer (Special) Recruitment 2026 has started on 01 June 2026 &amp; the candidates can apply till 30 June 2026. Candidates must check the complete details for Rajasthan RPSC School Lecturer (Special) Recruitment 2026 which has given below. </span></span></span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Rajasthan Public Service Commission (RPSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">RPSC School Lecturer (Special) Recruitment 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">RPSC Advt No 01/2026-27</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Notification Date : <strong>22 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>01 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>30 June 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>30 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Correction Last Date : <strong>10 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>06 December 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>Before Exam</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General / Other State : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>600/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">OBC / BC : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>400/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC / ST : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>400/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Correction Charge : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>500/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RPSC School Lecturer (Special) Notification 2026 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 January 2027</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age : <strong>21 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>40 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per RPSC School Lecturer (Special) Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RPSC School Lecturer (Special) 2026 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 121 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 42.8831%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name </strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 29.2405%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Category </strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.8763%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 42.8831%; text-align: center;\" rowspan=\"6\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">School Lecturer (Special)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 29.2405%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General </span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.8763%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">46</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.2405%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">EWS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.8763%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">11</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.2405%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">OBC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.8763%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">25</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.2405%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">MBC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.8763%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">06</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.2405%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.8763%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">19</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.2405%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">ST</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.8763%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">14</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>RPSC School Lecturer (Special) Online Form 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must have a <strong>Post Graduate degree</strong> or equivalent in <strong>English, Hindi, History, Political Science, Sociology, or Music,</strong> along with <strong>B.Ed. (Special Education) or B.Ed. with a 2-year Diploma in Special Education</strong> recognized by the Rehabilitation Council of India (RCI). Candidates should also have working knowledge of Hindi written in Devanagari script and <strong>knowledge of Rajasthani culture</strong>. Additionally, valid CRR registration with RCI before the examination date is mandatory.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Candidate Must Read the Official Notification Before Applying.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" wi